This is so awful.

277
00:19:45,237 --> 00:19:46,797
This can't be happening.

278
00:19:47,957 --> 00:19:50,537
I want Buzz to stay here with me!

279
00:19:50,537 --> 00:19:54,557
Aw, Yoko.

280
00:19:55,197 --> 00:19:56,657
You can't take him!

281
00:19:58,597 --> 00:20:00,017
I won't let you!

282
00:20:01,237 --> 00:20:03,097
He has to stay here!

283
00:20:06,237 --> 00:20:09,657
There's nothing like a crying little girl to really open your eyes.

284
00:20:09,857 --> 00:20:10,537
Put me down.

285
00:20:12,237 --> 00:20:13,957
You're completely right, Yoko.

286
00:20:14,257 --> 00:20:17,517
I'm sorry we were too scared to make the right decision earlier.

287
00:20:17,517 --> 00:20:21,637
We were dumb enough to think we'd be better off letting them take Boss!

288
00:20:21,897 --> 00:20:23,977
I'm ashamed it even crossed our minds.

289
00:20:24,557 --> 00:20:27,217
Boss is like family to us, and we all love him!

290
00:20:27,777 --> 00:20:29,137
As much as this island!

291
00:20:29,937 --> 00:20:33,477
And, and, and, and no way are we gonna let!

292
00:20:34,257 --> 00:20:37,057
Scum like you lot, take him from us!

293
00:20:37,737 --> 00:20:38,177
Yeah!

294
00:20:40,177 --> 00:20:44,537
Oh, now this is just pathetic.

295
00:20:44,537 --> 00:20:48,137
Some scrappy ninja turns on the waterworks and you go loco?

296
00:20:48,417 --> 00:20:49,737
It's like a melodrama.

297
00:20:49,957 --> 00:20:50,977
To make me sick.

298
00:20:51,237 --> 00:20:52,897
Death is their only option.

299
00:20:53,677 --> 00:20:55,737
Underdogs ready to be put down.

300
00:20:55,897 --> 00:20:56,597
So sad.

301
00:20:59,397 --> 00:21:01,537
Wait, is that...

302
00:21:02,417 --> 00:21:02,777
Huh?

303
00:21:07,777 --> 00:21:08,917
It's happening!

304
00:21:09,577 --> 00:21:11,037
Boss is shedding his skin!

305
00:21:11,037 --> 00:21:11,717
Oh!

306
00:21:28,277 --> 00:21:29,037
Ahh!

307
00:21:31,297 --> 00:21:31,717
Whoa!

308
00:21:34,197 --> 00:21:34,757
Ahh!

309
00:21:35,997 --> 00:21:36,457
S sabeayıo!

310
00:21:36,457 --> 00:21:37,957
Huh?

311
00:21:37,957 --> 00:21:38,497
Argh!

312
00:21:38,497 --> 00:21:52,117
How funny is that?

313
00:21:52,117 --> 00:21:54,717
That Tom Beetle killing his own allies.

314
00:22:01,717 --> 00:22:02,717
Boss!

315
00:22:08,497 --> 00:22:09,497
What's wrong?

316
00:22:09,497 --> 00:22:10,497
No, Boss.

317
00:22:10,497 --> 00:22:11,497
This is awful.

318
00:22:11,497 --> 00:22:13,497
It must have been too soon for him to mold.

319
00:22:13,497 --> 00:22:28,497
I do not claim to be an entomologist, but you didn't finish molding.

320
00:22:28,497 --> 00:22:29,497
How heartbreaking.

321
00:22:29,497 --> 00:22:31,497
You have my pity.

322
00:22:31,497 --> 00:22:34,497
Your screaming and crying won't do any good.

323
00:22:34,497 --> 00:22:38,497
No one's gonna save you whining peasants now that we got your guardian angel.

324
00:22:38,497 --> 00:22:40,497
The fight's not over yet.

325
00:22:40,497 --> 00:22:41,497
Huh?

326
00:22:41,497 --> 00:22:42,497
Gay?

327
00:22:42,497 --> 00:22:44,497
You didn't risk your life for nothing.

328
00:22:44,497 --> 00:22:46,497
We'll save your friends, Boss.

329
00:22:46,497 --> 00:22:47,497
We owe you that much.

330
00:22:47,497 --> 00:22:49,497
Leave everything to us.

331
00:22:53,497 --> 00:22:56,497
Well, the fun's over.

332
00:22:56,497 --> 00:22:58,497
It's time to get serious.

333
00:23:05,497 --> 00:23:13,497
In hopes of saving the giant beetle and protecting Little East Blue, its citizens follow Nami's secret clan and take to the island's labyrinth-like caves.

334
00:23:13,497 --> 00:23:20,497
Meanwhile, Luffy chases after Largo, but finds himself thwarted when Largo transforms his entire body into a net.

335
00:23:20,497 --> 00:23:24,497
On the next One Piece, a special presentation related to the movie.

336
00:23:24,497 --> 00:23:26,497
The battle is on.

337
00:23:26,497 --> 00:23:27,497
Luffy versus Largo.

338
00:23:27,497 --> 00:23:29,497
I am the king of the pirates.

